# {{Name}} Copilot instructions

This is a Gerber PowerShell plugin, not Gerber Core.
Read [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md) first; it owns the development contract.

Use only the public Gerber Plugin API v1 supplied to `Get-GerberPlugin`.
Command changes require source unit tests and built-module integration tests.
Use the NovaModuleTools build/test/local-publication workflow in AGENTS.md.

Scoped file rules live in `.github/instructions/`, the implementation role in
`.github/agents/`, and reusable task workflows in `.github/skills/`.
Do not duplicate the canonical guide here.
